on makes a complete and accurate assessment of the astronaut's attire impossible.\n\n: The image is a fragmented collage, and the full details of the astronaut's suit are not visible. Therefore, it is not possible to definitively identify what the astronaut is wearing.", "time_sec": 194.926, "generation_time_seconds": 194.4015, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0355, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
